Package: orbit-menu
Source: orbit-menu
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: unmade.space <https://github.com/Unmade760>
Depends: python3-gi, python3-dbus, appmenu-gtk3-module, python3:any
Recommends: bamfdaemon, libkeybinder-3.0-0
Section: python
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Unmade760/orbit-global-menu
Description: Companion daemon for the Orbit Global Menu GNOME Shell extension.
 Reads the menu an application exports over D-Bus and hands it to the
 extension, which draws it in the GNOME panel.
